Description: Provides an integrated and auditable workflow for partial least
    squares structural equation modeling (PLS-SEM), with a native R PLS-PM
    engine for continuous linear models and optional adapters to established
    engines including 'cSEM', 'seminr', 'plssem', 'plspm', and 'blavaan'.
    The package emphasizes explicit measurement and structural specification,
    bootstrap uncertainty, predictive assessment, multigroup analysis,
    nonlinear and multilevel extensions, publication-ready tables and figures,
    agronomic teaching datasets, and reproducible validation workflows.
